# ── Frontend environment variables ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Expo only exposes variables prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ to client-side code.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL
#   The URL of the wimakit-backend server.
#   - Leave blank in development: utils/api.ts auto-detects the correct host
#     per platform (LAN IP for physical device, 10.0.2.2 for Android emulator,
#     localhost for web/iOS simulator via Expo's own hostUri).
#   - Set this for staging/production builds:
#     EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-backend.fly.dev
#   - Do NOT set this to localhost for a device/emulator build — it will point
#     at the device itself, not your dev machine, and images/API will all fail.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
